      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors present a rare case of ileus caused by unusual cecum mobility. The 31-years old female patient was diagnosed ineffectively several times due to abdominal pain. The diagnostics, an attempt of a conservative treatment, along with surgical and postoperative treatment are discussed."},
